    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Imposing Mausoleum</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Navigation Sphere (any [approach] talent)</p>\n<p>While you are in a Navigation Sphere approach, whenever the GM rolls on a Random Encounter Table to determine what creatures you encounter, they roll twice and tell you both results (rolling for the number of creatures each time). You may then choose which of the two rolled encounters you wish to face.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
